  go      net/http.Server's HTTP/2 (TLSNextProto, Protocols), net/http.Request.ProtoMajor as the server reads it
  rust    -
  python  -
  note    added 2026-11-18: a stream whose ALPN chose h2 is served by `http2`, each request read whole and handed to the same handler; no h2c on a plain connection, whose first bytes would have to be given to `http2` past this package's reader

