capability client/proxy  a request sent through a proxy
  heroes  http.Proxy, http.Client, http.no_proxy, http.proxy_from_env, http.proxy_for
  go      net/http.ProxyFromEnvironment, net/http.ProxyURL, net/http.Transport.Proxy
